@startuml View Chat Rooms by User
actor User
participant ": ChatInboxPage " as ChatInboxPage
participant ": Router " as Router
participant ": ChatController " as ChatController
participant ": HttpContextService " as HttpContextService
participant ": ChatService " as ChatService
participant ": ChatRepository " as ChatRepository
participant ": UserService " as UserService
database Database

User->ChatInboxPage: 1. Navigate to Chat page
    activate User
    activate ChatInboxPage

ChatInboxPage->ChatInboxPage: 2. Render Chat Inbox Page

ChatInboxPage->Router: 3. Send GET /api/chat/rooms
    deactivate ChatInboxPage
    activate Router

Router->ChatController: 4. Route Request to Controller
    deactivate Router
    activate ChatController

ChatController->HttpContextService: 5. GetCurrentUserId()
    activate HttpContextService
    deactivate ChatController

HttpContextService->HttpContextService: 6. Extract userId from JWT token
HttpContextService-->ChatController: 7. Return userId
    activate ChatController
    deactivate HttpContextService

ChatController->ChatService: 8. GetUserRoomsWithNames(userId)
    deactivate ChatController
    activate ChatService

ChatService->ChatRepository: 9. GetRoomsByUserId(userId)
    activate ChatRepository

ChatRepository->Database: 10. Query ChatRooms WHERE ParticipantIds contains userId
    activate Database

Database-->ChatRepository: 11. Return ChatRooms list
    deactivate Database

ChatRepository-->ChatService: 12. Return ChatRooms
    deactivate ChatRepository

ChatService->ChatService: 13. Extract all participant IDs from rooms

loop for each participant ID
    ChatService->UserService: 14. GetUserByIdAsync(participantId)
        activate UserService
    UserService->Database: 15. Query User by Id
        activate Database
    Database-->UserService: 16. Return User data
        deactivate Database
    UserService-->ChatService: 17. Return User (FullName, AvatarUrl)
        deactivate UserService
end

loop for each room
    ChatService->ChatRepository: 18. GetLastMessageByRoomId(roomId)
        activate ChatRepository
    ChatRepository->Database: 19. Query ChatMessage WHERE RoomId = roomId ORDER BY Timestamp DESC LIMIT 1
        activate Database
    Database-->ChatRepository: 20. Return LastMessage or null
        deactivate Database
    ChatRepository-->ChatService: 21. Return LastMessage
        deactivate ChatRepository
end

ChatService->ChatService: 22. Map to ChatRoomDto (ParticipantNames, ParticipantAvatars, LastMessage, UnreadCount)

ChatService->ChatService: 23. Order by UpdatedAt DESC

ChatService-->ChatController: 24. Return List<ChatRoomDto>
    activate ChatController
    deactivate ChatService

ChatController-->Router: 25. Send Chat Rooms Response
    activate Router
    deactivate ChatController

Router-->ChatInboxPage: 26. Display Chat Rooms
    activate ChatInboxPage
    deactivate Router

ChatInboxPage->ChatInboxPage: 27. Map rooms (displayName, avatar, lastMessage, timestamp, unreadCount)

ChatInboxPage->ChatInboxPage: 28. Render Chat Rooms List

ChatInboxPage-->User: 29. Show Chat Rooms
    deactivate ChatInboxPage
    deactivate User
@enduml




